    "q-175947": {
      "dom_id": "step-q175947",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$15+(-3)^{3}÷{7}^{0}=${{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nNotice that ${7}^{0}=1.$ So, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15+(-3)^{3}÷{7}^{0} & = \\\\ 15+(-27)÷1 & = \\\\ 15+(-27) & = \\\\ 15-27 & = \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
